((eventName:(AuthorizeSecurityGroupIngress OR AuthorizeSecurityGroupEgress OR RevokeSecurityGroupIngress OR RevokeSecurityGroupEgress OR CreateSecurityGroup OR DeleteSecurityGroup)) OR (eventName:(CreateNetworkAclEntry OR ReplaceNetworkAclEntry OR DeleteNetworkAclEntry)) OR (eventName:(UpdateWebACL OR PutWebACL OR DeleteWebACL OR UpdateRuleGroup))) AND ((requestParameters.ipPermissions.items.ipRanges.items.cidrIp:0.0.0.0\/0 AND requestParameters.ipPermissions.items.ipv6Ranges.items.cidrIpv6:\:\:\/0) OR requestParameters.ipPermissions.items.ipProtocol:\-1 OR ((requestParameters.ipPermissions.items.fromPort:(22 OR 3389 OR 5985 OR 5986)) AND (requestParameters.ipPermissions.items.toPort:(22 OR 3389 OR 5985 OR 5986)))) AND (userIdentity.type:Root OR userIdentity.sessionContext.attributes.mfaAuthenticated:false OR (userAgent:(*python\-requests* OR *curl* OR *wget* OR *kali* OR *postman* OR *bot*)) OR userAgent:*aws\-cli*) AND (NOT ((userIdentity.arn:(*role\/Terraform* OR *role\/CloudFormation* OR *role\/AWSServiceRole* OR *role\/SecurityAutomation* OR *role\/OrganizationAccountAccessRole*)) OR (userIdentity.invokedBy:(autoscaling.amazonaws.com OR elasticloadbalancing.amazonaws.com))))
